    <data key="d0">Imperva Real-Time Security Event and Metric Ingestion Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ccPhkyPm_3w</data>
    <data key="d2">Imperva ingests security events and metric data from DDoS, Cloud WAF, Bot Protection, and Runtime Agents into AWS MSK, reducing data availability latency from 20 minutes down to less than 3 minutes.</data>
    <data key="d3">Security &amp; Compliance, Streaming, Data Lake &amp; Analytics</data>
